# Copy this file to .env and fill in real values to enable app/engines/bhashini_ocr_engine.py.
# .env is gitignored -- never commit real credentials.
#
# 1. Register at https://bhashini.gov.in/ulca (free) -> verify email -> log in.
# 2. Go to "My Profile" -> API Keys -> Generate. Copy the User ID and the
#    ULCA API Key it gives you.
# 3. In the ULCA model catalog, find an OCR model and subscribe/try it out to
#    get a Pipeline ID that bundles an OCR task. Known live OCR service IDs
#    as of this writing (see app/engines/bhashini_ocr_engine.py docstring):
#      - bhashini/iiith-bhasha-ocr        (printed text, ~22 languages)
#      - bhashini/iiith/ocr-hw-bhaasha    (handwritten, 8 languages)
#      - bhashini/iiith-ocr-sceneText-all (scene text, 13 languages)
#      - bhashini/bodhan/indic-doc/ocr    (printed + handwritten, Bodhan.AI)
#    iiith-bhasha-ocr is the closest match to this project's printed-field
#    dataset -- look for a pipeline that includes it.

BHASHINI_USER_ID=
BHASHINI_ULCA_API_KEY=
BHASHINI_PIPELINE_ID=
